  "description": "Retro, modern, and minimalist, all wrapped up into one. Meet the Classic 1 Step-Thru, a vintage-inspired take on the classic Schwinn women’s cruiser.\nThe Classic 1 gives every weekend ride an upgrade. Comfortability reigns supreme with this no-frills, single-speed blue bike. A steel frame and intuitive coaster brake promise smooth and leisurely riding. Some bikes are built for speed and sport; the Classic 1 Step-Thru knows that life isn’t meant to be a constant race. Enjoy exploring and taking things in with this icon of a Schwinn bike.",
